**Status — implemented reductions, verification pending (2026-11-15).** The established changed-input/borrowed-value and password-mask reductions remain. New source prepares camera/surface ownership, geometry, output mapping and perspective coefficients once per immutable-world text export; it reuses source-group ranges for neighbour links. The adapter receives changed/new nodes and focus/tree metadata instead of cloning the complete tree for every change. Initial attachment and explicit refresh/reset still send full snapshots.

**Evidence:** [Overhaul.md — source-only accessibility projection and publication](Overhaul.md#source-only-accessibility-projection-and-publication--2026-11-15). New code is unbuilt, untested and unmeasured. Existing consumer-inactive gating, full candidate reconstruction, per-output presentation receipts, catalog/action validation and protection remain.

**Why:** Text-cluster export should not repeat field-wide ownership/projection preparation, and one changed node should not require resending unchanged nodes.

**Remaining verification:** ACCESS-VERIFY in Overhaul.md covers tree equivalence, lifecycle/attachment, removals/reparenting/focus, Unicode/selection/neighbours, perspective/clipping/magnification and multiple presented outputs. Include no-consumer demand, password protection and stale-action rejection. Attribute complete build/text/composition/diff cost, emitted nodes, CPU/memory and input tails; diff bookkeeping must be counted, including fully changing scenes.

**Conditional follow-up:** full candidate-tree/text reconstruction still occurs while a consumer is active. A wider retained construction design requires a complete invalidation/ownership boundary and evidence that it earns its cost; no blanket disabling, stale grants or cross-frame projection cache is justified. Do not repeat the implemented value/mask work or partial-update delivery mechanism.

**Current workflow:** [Development cycle](record:r_043BC6V4K9R3X6E9E4TZP3P6J0). This phase remains source-only.
} r_1N8KS1ZEKV1WQX606K6MH5NKR1

